103	 * (`placeHostingOrder`) and the authoritative debit (`orderHostingAccountFor`) can
104	 * never diverge on a formula. `fullCharge` is the true total (plan term + storage
105	 * add-on); `promoCharge` is what a granted first-month-free reduces it to (one PLAN
106	 * month credited, the add-on never). All the underlying helpers are pure, so the two
107	 * call sites only ever differ by the DB reads (annual %, per-GB rate, eligibility)
108	 * they must each make against the same instant.
