701	 * Advisory UX for the deploy wizard — the authoritative de-dup is the atomic
702	 * UNIQUE(hostname) claim inside orderHostingAccount's charge tx, so a check that
703	 * says "available" can still lose a race and fail the order cleanly (no charge).
