1129	/**
1130	 * Which website an install / promotion action targets: the account's primary site
1131	 * (`public_html`), or one of its subdomains / addon domains (by row id). Omitting a
1132	 * target defaults to `primary` everywhere, so every existing single-site flow is
1133	 * unchanged.
